Milestone 006v2 completed on 2026-02-28.

Changes implemented:
1. GET /blocked-entity endpoint returns JSON array of all blocked entities with id, ip, uriPath, headers, expires_at (RFC3339)
2. Configurable default TTL via cache.blocklist-default-ttl-seconds in KDL config (default: 3600s)
3. Optional ?ttl=N query parameter on POST /blocked-entity to override default TTL
4. Entity metadata stored alongside blocklist entries via BlockWithMeta for admin-API blocks
5. BlockedEntityInfo model type for listing entries with metadata
6. Updated state sync serialization to include entity metadata (backward compatible via omitempty)
7. Fixed Fiber fasthttp buffer reuse bug: strings from c.Params() now cloned before storing in entity metadata

All tests pass. Lint clean.
